      "fontSize": 11.0,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "A regimen with strong randomised evidence may still have no commissioned route, and a routinely commissioned regimen may be off-label. Confirm the marketing",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A regimen with strong randomised evidence may still have no commissioned route, and a routinely commissioned regimen may be off-label. Confirm the marketing",
